			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Heh. True-nuff. It kinda feels like a mix of Spiritfarer and FTL, the “crew” is going around somewhat autonomously like FTL, but they’re also building things they need like Spiritfarer. But it all still works because there’s structure and direction. So no one’s capsized the boat. But maybe I’m stretching this analogy too far. 🤔</p>",
